Myopia:
Character with this attribute has normal vision limited to two squares.
Beyond that, anything seen will be hallucinated. Additionally, every
n250 turns, you will get confused from blurry vision. This can be cured
by wearing a pair of lenses (but not sunglasses). Non-myopic characters
will suffer the same effects when wearing a pair of lenses, besides
wizards, priests, and monks.
You have a chance of gaining myopia when you suffer light-based
blinding. It is considered a minor problem. It can only be cured by the
restore ability spell, quaffing a potion of restore ability, praying
with luck, quaffing a potion of extra or full healing, or a nighttime
gremlin attack. Nerds cannot be cured of myopia.

